                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Vagrant robots sleep rough and grafitti stuff.\n\nDo androids dream of electric sheep?  No, they dream of genocide.\n\n----------------\n\nPROS\n\n+ Cute\n+ Nice soundtrack\n\n-----------------\n\nCONS\n\n- Takes a lot of control away from the player, even for the most mundane tasks like walking around\n- Give you control sometimes to click through dialogue which you can't even read\n- Puzzles are uninspired and pretty boring\n- Terrible value for money\n\n------------------\n\nIn the end I played this for 2.2 hours and honestly had my fingers on the keyboard for about the 0.2 of that time.  \n\nI hate giving negative reviews but there are way better free games out there and a gazillion better ways to spend 10 dollars.",
